{%- doc -%}
  Reusable ground for the "Shop by Fragrance" stage, independent of any plant so it never has holes
  where a plant will grow. Rises in back-to-front with the scene (classes sfa-a / sfx-hill).

  Shapes (both on the designers' 1600x1800 canvas, soil line around y 1560-1610):
  - hills  : 3 bands (from the French Lavender artwork)
  - meadow : 4 bands (from the Jasmine Bloom artwork); the far pale band uses --ground-0
  Colours: --ground-1 (back), --ground-2 (middle), --ground-3 (front soil).

  @param {string} [shape] - hills (default) | meadow

  @example
  {% render 'swick-frag-ground', shape: 'meadow' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if shape == 'meadow' -%}
<svg class="sfx-ground-svg" viewBox="0 1100 1600 700" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" preserveAspectRatio="none">
  <path class="sfa-a sfx-hill" style="--d: 0.00s; fill: var(--ground-0, #f6fbe1);" d="M0 1800L0 1231L24 1233L40 1229L184 1150L196 1155L396 1271.7L1160 1151.5L1208 1139L1336 1222L1352 1234L1396 1275L1416 1288L1488 1326L1572 1376L1600 1371L1600 1800Z"/>
  <path class="sfa-a sfx-hill" style="--d: 0.10s; fill: var(--ground-1, #c0ce8c);" d="M0 1800L0 1231L28 1235L64 1249L132 1286L172 1314L224 1338L340 1383L380 1391L396 1391.6L1208 1284L1448 1370L1508 1386L1600 1372L1600 1800Z"/>
  <path class="sfa-a sfx-hill" style="--d: 0.20s; fill: var(--ground-2, #77844a);" d="M0 1800L0 1578L192 1530L364 1477L388 1457L396 1453L1212 1440L1380 1409L1600 1372L1600 1800Z"/>
  <path class="sfa-a sfx-hill" style="--d: 0.30s; fill: var(--ground-3, #475122);" d="M0 1800L0 1616L76 1636L172 1651L192 1650L252 1631L312 1620L340 1620L372 1626L396 1623.1L1212 1638L1324 1621L1416 1610L1600 1567L1600 1800Z"/>
</svg>
